   "source": [
    "# 00 · Entorno y Dependencias\n",
    "**Proyecto:** Predicción de Hospitalización por Dengue — Bucaramanga  \n",
    "**Fase:** Setup inicial  \n",
    "**Autor:** Maestría en IA / Ciencia de Datos  \n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Propósito de este notebook\n",
    "\n",
    "Este notebook cumple dos funciones:\n",
    "1. **Instalar y verificar** todas las dependencias necesarias para el pipeline completo.\n",
    "2. **Definir y exportar** la configuración central del proyecto: rutas, semillas aleatorias,\n",
    "   paletas de color y parámetros globales que garantizan reproducibilidad entre notebooks.\n",
    "\n",
    "> **Nota metodológica:** En epidemiología computacional es indispensable fijar una semilla aleatoria\n",
    "> (`RANDOM_STATE`) antes de cualquier partición de datos o entrenamiento de modelo. Esto garantiza que\n",
    "> los resultados sean reproducibles por otros investigadores, requisito central de la ciencia abierta.\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Instalación de dependencias\n",
    "\n",
    "El pipeline utiliza librerías de cuatro categorías:\n",
    "- **ML clásico:** scikit-learn, imbalanced-learn\n",
    "- **Boosting:** XGBoost, LightGBM, CatBoost (state-of-the-art en datos tabulares clínicos)\n",
    "- **Estadística:** statsmodels (para regresión logística interpretable con OR e IC95%)\n",
    "- **AutoML exploratorio:** PyCaret (barrido rápido de modelos baseline)\n",
    "\n",
    "> **¿Por qué boosting para datos de salud?** Los modelos de gradient boosting (XGBoost, LightGBM, CatBoost)\n",
    "> consistentemente superan a redes neuronales en datos tabulares clínicos de tamaño moderado\n",
    "> (Grinsztajn et al., 2022, NeurIPS). Adicionalmente, permiten cálculo de importancia de variables,\n",
    "> fundamental para la interpretabilidad clínica."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "# INSTALACIÓN DE DEPENDENCIAS\n",
    "# Se instala en modo silencioso (-q) para mantener el log limpio.\n",
    "# Versiones fijadas para reproducibilidad del entorno de maestría.\n",
    "# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "!pip install -q \\\n",
    "    numpy==1.26.4 \\\n",
    "    pandas==2.2.2 \\\n",
    "    matplotlib==3.8.4 \\\n",
    "    seaborn==0.13.2 \\\n",
    "    scikit-learn==1.4.2 \\\n",
    "    imbalanced-learn==0.12.3 \\\n",
    "    xgboost==2.0.3 \\\n",
    "    lightgbm==4.3.0 \\\n",
    "    catboost==1.2.5 \\\n",
    "    statsmodels==0.14.2 \\\n",
    "    scipy==1.13.0 \\\n",
    "    joblib==1.4.2\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✅ Dependencias instaladas correctamente\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Verificación del entorno"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "# VERIFICACIÓN: Imprime versiones de todas las librerías críticas.\n",
    "# Permite detectar conflictos de versión antes de ejecutar el pipeline.\n",
    "# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "import importlib\n",
    "\n",
    "librerias = [\n",
    "    \"numpy\", \"pandas\", \"matplotlib\", \"seaborn\",\n",
    "    \"sklearn\", \"imblearn\", \"xgboost\", \"lightgbm\",\n",
    "    \"catboost\", \"statsmodels\", \"scipy\", \"joblib\"\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"{'Librería':<20} {'Versión':<15} {'Estado'}\")\n",
    "print(\"-\" * 50)\n",
    "\n",
    "for lib in librerias:\n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        mod = importlib.import_module(lib)\n",
    "        version = getattr(mod, \"__version__\", \"N/A\")\n",
    "        print(f\"{lib:<20} {version:<15} ✅\")\n",
    "    except ImportError:\n",
    "        print(f\"{lib:<20} {'NO INSTALADA':<15} ❌\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\nPython: {sys.version}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Configuración central del proyecto\n",
    "\n",
    "Centralizar la configuración en un único lugar evita inconsistencias entre notebooks\n",
    "(por ejemplo, usar semillas distintas en distintos notebooks, lo que hace irreproducible\n",
    "la comparación de modelos)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "# CONFIGURACIÓN GLOBAL DEL PROYECTO\n",
    "# Todos los notebooks importan desde src/config.py para garantizar\n",
    "# coherencia en rutas, semillas y parámetros visuales.\n",
    "# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "import os\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── Rutas del proyecto ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "PROJECT_ROOT = Path(\"../..\")  # Raíz del repositorio\n",
    "DATA_RAW     = PROJECT_ROOT / \"data\" / \"raw\"\n",
    "DATA_INTERIM = PROJECT_ROOT / \"data\" / \"interim\"\n",
    "DATA_PROC    = PROJECT_ROOT / \"data\" / \"processed\"\n",
    "OUT_FIGURES  = PROJECT_ROOT / \"outputs\" / \"figures\"\n",
    "OUT_TABLES   = PROJECT_ROOT / \"outputs\" / \"tables\"\n",
    "OUT_MODELS   = PROJECT_ROOT / \"outputs\" / \"models\"\n",
    "CHECKPOINTS  = PROJECT_ROOT / \"outputs\" / \"checkpoints\"\n",
    "\n",
    "# Crear directorios si no existen\n",
    "for path in [DATA_RAW, DATA_INTERIM, DATA_PROC,\n",
    "             OUT_FIGURES, OUT_TABLES, OUT_MODELS, CHECKPOINTS]:\n",
    "    path.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── Semilla aleatoria ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "# Usar 42 por convención; lo importante es que sea SIEMPRE la misma.\n",
    "RANDOM_STATE = 42\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── Partición train/test ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "# 80/20 estratificado por variable objetivo para mantener proporciones de clase.\n",
    "TEST_SIZE = 0.20\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── Validación cruzada ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "# 5-fold estratificado: balance entre varianza del estimador y costo computacional.\n",
    "CV_FOLDS = 5\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── Paleta de colores del proyecto ───────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "# Colores institucionales / consistentes con publicaciones biomédicas.\n",
    "COLORS = {\n",
    "    \"primary\":     \"#2C7BB6\",   # Azul: clase negativa (no hospitalizado)\n",
    "    \"secondary\":   \"#D7191C\",   # Rojo: clase positiva (hospitalizado)\n",
    "    \"accent\":      \"#FDAE61\",   # Naranja: advertencias / destacados\n",
    "    \"neutral\":     \"#7F7F7F\",   # Gris: líneas de referencia\n",
    "    \"background\":  \"#F8F9FA\",   # Fondo suave\n",
    "    \"con_signos\":  \"#E74C3C\",   # Dengue con signos de alarma\n",
    "    \"sin_signos\":  \"#3498DB\",   # Dengue sin signos de alarma\n",
    "    \"grave\":       \"#8E44AD\",   # Dengue grave\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "PALETTE_HOSPIT = [COLORS[\"primary\"], COLORS[\"secondary\"]]\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── Estilo global de matplotlib ───────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.rcParams.update({\n",
    "    \"figure.dpi\":        150,        # Alta resolución en pantalla\n",
    "    \"savefig.dpi\":       300,        # Resolución de publicación al exportar\n",
    "    \"figure.facecolor\":  \"white\",\n",
    "    \"axes.facecolor\":    \"white\",\n",
    "    \"axes.spines.top\":   False,\n",
    "    \"axes.spines.right\": False,\n",
    "    \"axes.titlesize\":    14,\n",
    "    \"axes.titleweight\":  \"bold\",\n",
    "    \"axes.labelsize\":    12,\n",
    "    \"xtick.labelsize\":   10,\n",
    "    \"ytick.labelsize\":   10,\n",
    "    \"legend.fontsize\":   10,\n",
    "    \"font.family\":       \"DejaVu Sans\",\n",
    "})\n",
    "\n",
    "sns.set_theme(style=\"whitegrid\", font_scale=1.1)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✅ Configuración cargada correctamente\")\n",
    "print(f\"   Semilla aleatoria : {RANDOM_STATE}\")\n",
    "print(f\"   Test size         : {TEST_SIZE:.0%}\")\n",
    "print(f\"   CV folds          : {CV_FOLDS}\")\n",
    "print(f\"   Raíz del proyecto : {PROJECT_ROOT.resolve()}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Exportar configuración como módulo Python\n",
    "\n",
    "La configuración se guarda en `src/config.py` para que cualquier notebook\n",
    "pueda importarla con `sys.path.insert(0, '../../src'); import config`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "# GENERA src/config.py — módulo importable desde cualquier notebook\n",
    "# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "config_content = '''\n",
    "\"\"\"Configuración central del proyecto de predicción de hospitalización por dengue.\"\"\"\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "PROJECT_ROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent\n",
    "DATA_RAW     = PROJECT_ROOT / \"data\" / \"raw\"\n",
    "DATA_INTERIM = PROJECT_ROOT / \"data\" / \"interim\"\n",
    "DATA_PROC    = PROJECT_ROOT / \"data\" / \"processed\"\n",
    "OUT_FIGURES  = PROJECT_ROOT / \"outputs\" / \"figures\"\n",
    "OUT_TABLES   = PROJECT_ROOT / \"outputs\" / \"tables\"\n",
    "OUT_MODELS   = PROJECT_ROOT / \"outputs\" / \"models\"\n",
    "CHECKPOINTS  = PROJECT_ROOT / \"outputs\" / \"checkpoints\"\n",
    "\n",
    "RANDOM_STATE = 42\n",
    "TEST_SIZE    = 0.20\n",
    "CV_FOLDS     = 5\n",
    "\n",
    "TARGET_COL   = \"TARGET_HOSPITALIZACION_ORIGINAL\"\n",
    "CLASFINAL_CON_SIGNOS = \"DENGUE CON SIGNOS DE ALARMA\"\n",
    "CLASFINAL_SIN_SIGNOS = \"DENGUE SIN SIGNOS DE ALARMA\"\n",
    "\n",
    "SIGNOS_ALARMA = [\n",
    "    \"DOLOR_ABDO\", \"VOMITO\", \"DIARREA\", \"SOMNOLENCI\",\n",
    "    \"HIPOTENSIO\", \"HEPATOMEG\", \"HEM_MUCOSA\",\n",
    "    \"HIPOTERMIA\", \"AUM_HEMATO\", \"CAIDA_PLAQ\", \"ACUM_LIQUI\"\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "SINTOMAS_GENERALES = [\n",
    "    \"FIEBRE\", \"CEFALEA\", \"DOLRRETROO\",\n",
    "    \"MALGIAS\", \"ARTRALGIA\", \"ERUPCIONR\"\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "VARIABLES_DEMOGRAFICAS = [\n",
    "    \"SEXO_\", \"DEF_CLAS_EDAD\", \"TIP_SS_\", \"ESTRATO_\",\n",
    "    \"GP_GESTAN\", \"GRUPO_ETARIO\"\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "COLORS = {\n",
    "    \"primary\":    \"#2C7BB6\",\n",
    "    \"secondary\":  \"#D7191C\",\n",
    "    \"accent\":     \"#FDAE61\",\n",
    "    \"neutral\":    \"#7F7F7F\",\n",
    "    \"con_signos\": \"#E74C3C\",\n",
    "    \"sin_signos\": \"#3498DB\",\n",
    "    \"grave\":      \"#8E44AD\",\n",
    "}\n",
    "'''\n",
    "\n",
    "src_path = PROJECT_ROOT / \"src\" / \"config.py\"\n",
    "src_path.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "src_path.write_text(config_content)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"✅ Configuración exportada a: {src_path}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
